# Engine Rules

**Full detail:** [docs/ai/03-engine.md](../../docs/ai/03-engine.md), [docs/ai/04-actions-and-requests.md](../../docs/ai/04-actions-and-requests.md)

## Scope

`lib/engine/` — interpret `ComponentConfig` trees into widgets.

## Must

- Implement `ComponentRenderer` for new types
- Register in `ScreenRenderer._createDefaultRenderers`
- Add schema in `component_schemas.dart`
- Keep renderers free of product/auth/catalog rules
- Resolve display values via `dataContext` paths (`valuePath`, `urlPath`)

## Must not

- Import feature repos or call `ProductRepo` / `AuthRepo`
- Encode merchant-specific layout decisions
- Add API fetching in renderers (orchestration lives in `VariantScreen`)

## Key files

- `screen_renderer/screen_renderer.dart` — registry (19 types + unsupported)
- `actions/action_dispatcher.dart` — `tap` handlers
- `requests/request_mapper.dart` — collect `data.requestUrl`
- `tree/renderers/*.dart` — implementations

## Actions

`tap.type`: `navigate` | `apiCall` | `cubitCall` — see action_dispatcher.dart
